; XAUUSD FTMO Confluence EA - TIMEFRAME COMPARISON TF_M5
;
; ENUM_TIMEFRAMES values are not contiguous (M30=30, H1=16385), so a
; step-based sweep would iterate thousands of invalid values. Timeframes
; are therefore compared as discrete single runs, not optimised.
;
; ATR bounds are scaled by sqrt(period) from the M15 baseline and are a
; STARTING POINT only - re-run Stage3 per timeframe to calibrate them.
;
